    "Definition 23", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "7c68c881-97a1-4803-8661-618fa91a799f"], Cell["\<\
Parallel lines are those in a plane which do not meet, however far produced.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"6014ed1b-1c0f-49a4-b8de-d9d87843ed43"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "a02a6846-2cd1-48dd-a9d4-9890fdb4dd5d"], Cell[
