    "Euclid's axiom, stated with betweenness and equidistance.", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"ed2e8a9b-3967-4265-b944-33133d0a7c02"]}
  }]], "3ColumnTableMod",ExpressionUUID->"f9538c83-eb27-4001-893e-\
e1478aec5dd4"]
}, Open  ]],

